<title>CHINA: China sugar output at 4.6563 mln T in first half.</title>
<headline>China sugar output at 4.6563 mln T in first half.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's sugar output totalled 4.6563 million tonnes in the first half of this year, up 12.6 percent compared with the year-ago period, figures available on Friday from the State Statistical Bureau showed.</p>
<p>It gave no more details.</p>
<p>State media said earlier that output for the 1996/97 (October/April) crushing season was 6.76 million tonnes, up more than 530,000 tonnes from the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86) 10-6532-1921; Fax 10-6532-4978</p>
